msgstr ""
"Potrebno je potvrđivanje identiteta za uklanjanje uređaja upravljanog bojom"

#. SECURITY:
#. - Normal users should not have to authenticate to delete profiles
#: policy/org.freedesktop.color.policy.in.in:65
